# Normalize line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) rewrite LF to CRLF, which
# trips prettier's default endOfLine:'lf' check and fails `next build`. Keeping
# LF in the working tree makes local lint and CI (Vercel/Render run on Linux)
# agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep these as-is; they must stay byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
